# Results vs Discussion

Results (publication §6) report what was tested and what the numbers are.
Discussion (§7) interprets. Do not put design implications, H1–H3 claims,
“what this means for ads/trust,” “precise null vs dead pipeline,” or
“do not put this in the abstract” into Results.

EEG 6.3 (`sec:results-eeg`) is confirmatory numbers, tables, forests.
EEG interpretation lives in 7.3 (`Heterogeneity, EEG, and trajectories`).
Limitations stay in 7.5.

